@startuml activity-update-shipping-status
' Update shipping status: GHN reports each change of a shipment (webhook).
' Events are checked and handled once.

title Update shipping status

|GHN|
|Coffee Shop System|
|Payment gateway|
|Email service|

|GHN|
start
:Send a status event\n(picked, delivered, returned);
|Coffee Shop System|
:Check the event signature;
if (Valid?) then ([no])
  :Reject the event;
  stop
else ([yes])
endif
:Find the order\n(by tracking number);
if (Already up to date?) then ([yes])
  :Ignore the event;
  stop
else ([no])
endif
switch (New status?)
case ([shipping])
  :Set SHIPPING;
case ([delivered])
  :Set DELIVERED\n(order Completed);
  if (Cash on delivery?) then ([yes])
    :Mark the payment PAID;
  else ([no])
  endif
case ([returned])
  :Set RETURNED\n(items back in stock);
  if (Paid online?) then ([yes])
    |Payment gateway|
    :Refund the payment;
  else ([no])
  endif
endswitch
|Email service|
:Email the customer the new status;
stop

@enduml
